// a2vue golden case 002 — markdown tag content prop binding.
// Verifies plan 022 Phase 7c fix for §10: `markdown { content: .body }` must
// bind content (NOT leak `content: .body` as literal text into the tag body).
// Plan 040: 主名翻转后 legacy `markdown` 别名经 schema canonical → autodown
// 解析为 <StreamingRenderer :source=..>（换绑超集组件，此 golden 同时锁
// 别名路径）。
widget DocView {
    model { var body str = "" }
    view {
        col {
            style: "doc-wrap"
            markdown {
                content: .body
                style: "doc-content"
            }
        }
    }
    on { }
}
